        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Recall that for <span class=\"math\">[MATH: x &gt;0,]</span> we have </p>",
            "readable_text": "Recall that for [MATH: x >0,] we have",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\dfrac{\\textrm d }{\\textrm d x}(\\ln{x}) = \\dfrac 1 x.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "[MATH: \\dfrac{\\textrm d }{\\textrm d x}(\\ln{x}) = \\dfrac 1 x.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We can generalize this to all values <span class=\"math\">[MATH: x\\neq 0]</span> by including an absolute value inside the natural logarithm: </p>",
            "readable_text": "We can generalize this to all values [MATH: x\\neq 0] by including an absolute value inside the natural logarithm:",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\dfrac{\\textrm d }{\\textrm d x}(\\ln{|x|}) = \\dfrac 1 x.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "[MATH: \\dfrac{\\textrm d }{\\textrm d x}(\\ln{|x|}) = \\dfrac 1 x.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Therefore, the integral of the reciprocal function is\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\int \\dfrac 1 x \\,\\textrm{d}x = \\ln |x| + C.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Therefore, the integral of the reciprocal function is\n[MATH: \\int \\dfrac 1 x \\,\\textrm{d}x = \\ln |x| + C.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Content:\nRecall that for [MATH: x >0,] we have\n\nContent:\n[MATH: \\dfrac{\\textrm d }{\\textrm d x}(\\ln{x}) = \\dfrac 1 x.]\n\nContent:\nWe can generalize this to all values [MATH: x\\neq 0] by including an absolute value inside the natural logarithm:\n\nContent:\n[MATH: \\dfrac{\\textrm d }{\\textrm d x}(\\ln{|x|}) = \\dfrac 1 x.]\n\nContent:\nTherefore, the integral of the reciprocal function is\n[MATH: \\int \\dfrac 1 x \\,\\textrm{d}x = \\ln |x| + C.]"
      },
      {
