        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Calculate <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\displaystyle\\int \\left(\\dfrac 2 x\\right)\\, \\textrm{d} x.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Calculate [MATH: \\displaystyle\\int \\left(\\dfrac 2 x\\right)\\, \\textrm{d} x.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>First, we apply the constant factor rule and take the coefficient <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2]</span> out of the integral. Then we compute the integral of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\dfrac 1 x,]</span> and get\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: \u222b((2)/(x))dx|= 2\u222b(1)/(x)dx; = 2\\ln|x|+ C.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "First, we apply the constant factor rule and take the coefficient [MATH: 2] out of the integral. Then we compute the integral of [MATH: \\dfrac 1 x,] and get\n[MATH: \u222b((2)/(x))dx|= 2\u222b(1)/(x)dx; = 2\\ln|x|+ C.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nCalculate [MATH: \\displaystyle\\int \\left(\\dfrac 2 x\\right)\\, \\textrm{d} x.]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nFirst, we apply the constant factor rule and take the coefficient [MATH: 2] out of the integral. Then we compute the integral of [MATH: \\dfrac 1 x,] and get\n[MATH: \u222b((2)/(x))dx|= 2\u222b(1)/(x)dx; = 2\\ln|x|+ C.]"
      },
