        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Find the integral of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\dfrac 1 {2x} + 3x]</span> with respect to <span class=\"math\">[MATH: x.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Find the integral of [MATH: \\dfrac 1 {2x} + 3x] with respect to [MATH: x.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Applying the sum and constant factor rules, we get\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: \u222b((1)/(2x) + 3x)dx|= \u222b(1)/(2x)dx + \u222b3xdx; = (1)/(2)\u222b(1)/(x)dx + 3\u222bxdx; = (1)/(2)\\ln|x|+ 3 \u22c5 (x^{1 + 1})/(1 + 1) + C; = (\\ln|x|)/(2) + (3x^{2})/(2) + C.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Applying the sum and constant factor rules, we get\n[MATH: \u222b((1)/(2x) + 3x)dx|= \u222b(1)/(2x)dx + \u222b3xdx; = (1)/(2)\u222b(1)/(x)dx + 3\u222bxdx; = (1)/(2)\\ln|x|+ 3 \u22c5 (x^{1 + 1})/(1 + 1) + C; = (\\ln|x|)/(2) + (3x^{2})/(2) + C.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nFind the integral of [MATH: \\dfrac 1 {2x} + 3x] with respect to [MATH: x.]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nApplying the sum and constant factor rules, we get\n[MATH: \u222b((1)/(2x) + 3x)dx|= \u222b(1)/(2x)dx + \u222b3xdx; = (1)/(2)\u222b(1)/(x)dx + 3\u222bxdx; = (1)/(2)\\ln|x|+ 3 \u22c5 (x^{1 + 1})/(1 + 1) + C; = (\\ln|x|)/(2) + (3x^{2})/(2) + C.]"
      },
