          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>For any constant <span class=\"math\">[MATH: C,]</span> we can always write <span class=\"math\">[MATH: C = \\ln K,]</span> where <span class=\"math\">[MATH: K&gt;0]</span> is some other constant. Then, using the laws of logarithms, we can write</p>",
