        "readable_text": "Prompt:\nWhat is the antiderivative of [MATH: (8)/(3x)?]\n\nChoices:\na. [MATH: (8)/(3)\\ln (K|x|)]\nb. [MATH: (1)/(3)\\ln (8K|x|)]\nc. [MATH: (1)/(3)\\ln (8|x|+ K)]\nd. [MATH: \\ln ((8)/(3)K|x|)]\ne. [MATH: (8)/(3)\\ln (|x|+ K)]"
